<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.18 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-mo BUBOR rate 21.50 pct, 3-mo 21.18 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) were steady for one-month and weaker for three-month on Thursday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed unchanged at 21.50 percent, while the three-month rate fell to 21.18 percent from 21.23 percent, the NBH said on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
